{
  "slug": "steering-log",
  "name": "Steering Log",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that automatically detects and logs human steering moments from AI-assisted development sessions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`, `PostCompact`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install steering-log@claude-community` from `hanlogy/steering-log`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that automatically detects and logs moments of human judgment in a Claude Code session — no manual commands, no interruptions.",
